(text "Plugs into the main board on two 2.54 mm headers. Power pins: 4 per rail, about 3 A each." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 51a1bf4b-7a4d-4043-9dee-0420881f227f))
(text "eFuse settings: OVP 31.8 V (255k/10k), current limit 6.0 A (3.01k), UVLO default 15.5 V, about 11 ms soft start at 24 V (22 nF)." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 52d5e031-2584-41bf-8809-1d641c87252d))
(text "MODE open = latch-off after an overload (default). Close JP to GND for auto-retry. SHDN left open (internal pull-up)." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid aa66332b-c36b-4d1f-9c65-29f521bbf07f))
(text "PGTH and PGOOD are tied to GND (power-good unused; TI allows PGOOD at GND). FLT and IMON go to the main board." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ac51ad68-79c5-41f7-be95-ad2f98e993b1))
(text "Reverse polarity: Q1 blocks it (TI arrangement: Q1 source to IN_SYS, drain to IN, gate to B_GATE; Q2 pulls B_GATE down)." (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3215e196-f4e6-47bf-90c9-aacce7689352))
(text "TVS SMCJ51CA: stays off with a 48 V supply plugged in by mistake; the eFuse OVP disconnects the board." (at 20.32 39.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 13ef43e3-d427-428c-a551-c91f18d60b97))
(text "TPS7A4901: +5VA = 1.185 V x (1 + 32.4k/10k) = 5.02 V. 10 nF on NR/SS and across the top resistor (CFF)." (at 20.32 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d432e819-827b-41f7-ab4c-cdaa887af830))
